Subject: [PATCH] providers: a balance card draws its curve again, the estimate
 or not
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

KeyBalances handed noteBalanceHistory a clone of the cards, the estimate
filter's doing (f852532), and the trends were written on that copy: the
cards the callers got had no balanceTrend at all, so every balance card's
"Balance over time" went blank in 0.1.3305 while the readings went on
being kept (nina7274's #5682). The filter lives in noteBalanceHistory
now, and the call hands it the cards themselves, trends and all.

